# Documentation Maintenance

When changing code in this project, update `docs/PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` in the same task if the change affects structure or behavior.

Update the document when:

- Files are added, removed, renamed, or repurposed.
- Component responsibilities change.
- Car model paths or wrap options change.
- 3D loading, material application, or viewer controls change.
- Page layout or styling responsibilities change.

Do not leave the structure document stale after implementation changes.
